: "ss2.png", "id": "595536783505016", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392056_595536790171682_3839847209184424706_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b84XPnUD8rAQ7kNvwG-_cf_&_nc_oc=AdpYoiLztTC8WrbEwZAPCrbuPq59IKJ5DYulzokn0EvvmLaUMEnvmKRoOrkBNDSB-zY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSQE99l7eNauPMUpppXEClj0LvTAEbtDk7jJ4iLJG6JYQ&oe=6B0DB3D6"}, {"file_name": "ss3.png", "id": "692509553174676", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391865_692509559841342_1281660622671555734_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YCaLoReY5NwQ7kNvwHYf2RS&_nc_oc=AdpcyipFpNRAb_4Xet2wCCqO-oP_00ahXwviY1hgwgPIiNa4VToSRb_ztnWOizIdGSk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQPEW7ax3I-JzEqMS5_zKur0r_145ezG_6ZNupFO9PGCA&oe=6B0DA8DB"}, {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "971983221584377", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393444_971983224917710_9141865602563879347_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dRu-E7acn8UQ7kNvwH99UqO&_nc_oc=AdrM4QmPqOypZdnbXhZ_Otj4wvpJ2tNSANt-W9PPyi4L2oDB_t7pO7OZ3EAp9PNfNnw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS5VJFZZWF5M7rg3n174K8lD8G0b5oWHwnK3hrnmGLsOQ&oe=6B0DA3EE"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1309599546937172", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393406_1309599550270505_2614097177894914330_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=23LQYdd28r0Q7kNvwFB1dhG&_nc_oc=AdrpFgxiq-bfMkf2l6rRhCbmdakE67lwK0nW4dHM4w3fTAJKdeVcZ-lXnMSX98LdnP0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSEpRHOYOpcg_MoVniXO8Y_A2seBKejf3nkgrRUNhoSRA&oe=6B0D9CF6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "meta-landscape.png", "id": "538600862232071", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393351_538600865565404_8021931410350376011_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PKW7di6kWaAQ7kNvwGteXEF&_nc_oc=Adq_QGOqPICBrcBSbwiHmF7KKTeXX8iosvxjdwrjtOHUkcNmwqZBXQavEl9XzrLWSSU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS8x3hbSkCUa62LaSUYaI8ZIu1qFWCFQtujVvzGmtEOug&oe=6B0DC84D"}, "display_name": "Neon Cipher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Neon Cipher is an action-packed puzzle-platformer designed for smooth and engaging gameplay. Across 50 levels, you'll use third- and first-person mechanics to solve intricate puzzles and battle enemies blocking your path.\n\nAs a new recruit in a small team of hackers, your mission is to infiltrate XE_CORP's archive database and retrieve vital information for the Edenite Rebellion, crucial to its survival.\n\n# Third-Person Gameplay\n{663687826393284}\nUse classic third-person controls to move your character around, attack, enemies and interact with objects. Collect all the keys to open the door and complete each cipher.\n\n# First-Person Gameplay\n{1327023925018371}\nSometimes your character may need a little help. Reach into the cipher with your controllers to move platforms. Also you can stun enemies to make the fighting a little easier.\n\n# Editor\n{1009083324695992}\nCreate and play your own ciphers using the built-in editor.\n\n*A note on legacy headset support:\nPlease note, versions of Neon Cipher for Meta Quest 2 and Pro are still in development. We hope to bring them to you as soon as we can!", "short_description": "Neon Cipher is an action-packed puzzle-platformer designed for smooth and engaging gameplay. Across 50 levels, you'll use third- and first-person mechanics to solve intricate puzzles and battle enemies blocking your path."}]}, "developer_name": "eXomorph Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://exomorph.games/privacy-neon-cipher", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "eXomorph Games", "support_website_url": null, "web